<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[500]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transcervical Resection of Endometrium.</span></p>
