<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[502]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  - Endo laser Ablation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[503]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd:</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Not </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Op</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erator</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Dependent (Non-Hysteroscopic) </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[504]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- thermal Balloon Ablation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[505]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- bipolar radiofrequency endometrial ablation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[506]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Hydrothermal  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[507]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Indications:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[508]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>patient Not fit or refuses for surgery</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[509]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometrium </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>along with inner</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 5mm of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>yometrium need to be destroyed.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[510]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Contraindications:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[511]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>U</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>terine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> size &gt; 10wks.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[512]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Myometrial wall Thickness &lt;8mm.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[513]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Structural uterine anomaly.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[514]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Histological uterine Anomaly.</span></span></div>
