<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[568]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>S/S:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cyclical unilateral/ Bilateral pelvic pain with vaginal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>spotting</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
