<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[663]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti-spasmodic+ analgesics</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[664]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vital Monitor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resuscitation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Facilities</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should be available</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[665]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Catheter enters rt </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>femoral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> artery percutaneously. From Femoral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> it goes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> External iliac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>artery and then to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>common iliac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Artry. From common iliac it goes to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>the internal iliac and finally </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to the </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uterine artery.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[666]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>embolic agent 300-75</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0micrometer</span></span></div>
