<h2 class="mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1592]" style="background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>20</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>. FEMALE GENITAL MUTILATION (FGM):</strong></span></h2>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1593]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>WHO FGM Classification:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1594]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Type I:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Partial/Total removal of clitor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prepuce, clitoridectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1595]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Type II:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Type </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + removal of labia minor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a with or without</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> labia Major</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (excision).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1596]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Type III: </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>infibulation:</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1597]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Narrowing of vaginal orifice with creation of a covering seal by cutting and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a positioning</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> the labia minora &amp;/or a major</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with or without excision of clitoris. </span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1598]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Type </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>I</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>V:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> All other harmful procedure to genital</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for non-medical purposes like: pricing, pricking, incising, scraping &amp; cauterization.</span></span></div>
