<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2807]" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Examination</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>GPE:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Body hairs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gynecomastia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Androgen deficiency</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Height, w</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>eigh</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t, BMI.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Local:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Palpation of VAS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>defe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ren</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ce</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Scrotu</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>m:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Size by or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>chidometer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20ml – (N).</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consistency </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>firm (N)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>soft (abnormal)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hard (abnormal).</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Epididy</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>mi</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>s</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>varicoce</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>le – bag of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>w</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>orm.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More on left side </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>W</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ith</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Valsal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>v</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Peni</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>s:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Micro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>penis.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospadias</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>P</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>/R</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prosta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>te.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Seminal vesicle.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigation</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>HSA:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>72 hours’ abstinence.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Endocrinology:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>count</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt;5M/ml.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testosterone, FSH, LH.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prolactin.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TSH if,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduced libido.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Impotence.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Genetic screening:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Severe oligo/Azo</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>ospermia</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Concentration &lt;15M/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>l</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Total count &lt;5M/ejaculate.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong>Karyotyping:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Most frequently detected sex chromosomal abnormality </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Klinefelter</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> 11% in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>azoospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong>Microdeletions:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>10 – 15% with azo.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>2 – 10% with severe oligo.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>AZF</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>c</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>– good prognosis </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>with surgical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> retrieval.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>AZFa</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>,</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong> AZFb:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> poor prognosis of ART.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Imaging:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Testicular USG:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>If abnormality detected on examination.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Renal USG:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>If absence of VAS, 30% association with Renal Abnormality.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>Testicular Biopsy:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Open</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>percutaneous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Severe oli</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>go/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Azo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>ospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>ICSI</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>.</span></p>
