<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3254]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exposure </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of HCG o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r LH after ovarian stimulation by FSH.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3255]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3256]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3257]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Release</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of VEGF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
