<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3971]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk factor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> malignancy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3972]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symptoms of malignancy (same as</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in premenopausal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3973]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Family history of CA ovary, bowel and Breast.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3974]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women is high risk of CA if she is 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> degree relative of Cancer Affected.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3975]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Significant family Hx:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3976]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2 cases of malignancy who r 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> degree relative of each other</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3977]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>1 </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>case of CA ovary </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>any age +1 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>case of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA breast, &lt;50years relative of each other’s.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3978]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 case of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ovary </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>any age + 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cases of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CA breast &lt;60years relative of each other.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3979]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">4.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 or more cases of CA colon</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3980]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3981]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>In 2 generations + diagnosed before 50 + 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> degree relative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> colon + 1 CA stomach.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3982]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OR</span></p>
