<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4733]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>                  </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>typical </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>yperplasia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> AH</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - 0.5% death</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 2% CA with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mets</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 4% CA ovary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 43% concurrent CA - </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>endometrium</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>          </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>         </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>  </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Hysteroscopy</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fertility Required</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Yes </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- MDT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Pre treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- IUS – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- progesterone – 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Line + counselling</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> regarding</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Progression</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Follow – up.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>E</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ndometrial</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>yperplasia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> EH</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
