<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4738]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BMI - &gt;35 – 10% risk of EH</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4739]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT – optimize dose/ regimen.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4740]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tumors – Granulosa cell tumor.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4741]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>E &amp; inhibin levels should be checked</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4742]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>No</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lines</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  -TAH =&gt;premenopausal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- laparoscopy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>preferred</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- avoid, morcellation.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- TAH + BSO =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>post-menopausal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- TA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ilateral salpingectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt;Pre – Menopausal.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Removal of ovaries in pre – menopausal is individualized.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tamoxifen – oncologist discussion.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4743]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>Asymptomatic + R.F</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Observation:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regress = 74 – 81%</span></p>
