<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4753]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral progestogen (continuous).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4754]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medroxy progesterone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acetate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10 – 20mg/day.</span></span></div>
