an class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ernal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> urethral compression.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>3. Prolapse – (Bladder outflow obstruction).</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>4. A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>contractile</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> detrusor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:141.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>3. Very High Q Max</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-04-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" viewbox="0 0 1057275 657225" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="738e11df189603dc1edda3e79be86cf068e4e7fc7f3099dc2630a6481ef59332"><defs><clippath id="clip-1595a7a747ba876c41b6" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 1049530 0 L 1049530 650435 L 0 650435 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="1595a7a747ba876c41b6" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-1595a7a747ba876c41b6)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ce71af21c15c33d120c48c2167036eee517b15828410a56b1b0309cec96135f2.jfif" x="-93803.01996013" y="-1160604.95545037" width="1260454.44719333" height="1811039.95545037" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:126.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>1. Detrusor over Activity. </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cystometry:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Normal cytogram.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5453]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5454]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Bladder Volume = 300 – 600ml.  </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>(decrease</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> in OAB &amp; fibrosis</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>)</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5455]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Residual volume &lt;50ml.</strong></u></span></span></div>
