<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5871]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Malignant change/ calculi:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5872]" style="padding-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Firm, irregular mass with induration + blood.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5873]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigations:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5874]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urethroscopy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mucosal defect in 70% but recurrent inflammation may obscure ostia.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5875]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urodynamic:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all Pts.</span></span></div>
