lass="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>vulval + intra Breast </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>pargets</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:53.6pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>90-90% candida Albicans</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>75% women @ least single episode</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>45%@</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>least (2) episode</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>20% asymptomatic with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>colonization</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>(absence of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>neutrophils </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>on </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>microscopy)</s