t''><u><strong>Severe</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Fluconazole D1 &amp; D4 or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>clotrimazole </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>500 D1 &amp; D4</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:54.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Clotrimazole cream 5g st</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>at or clotrimazole pessary 200mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>nights.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.65pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Fluco</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>nazole</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> daily for 72 hours then weekly for 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>clotrim</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>azole</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> or topical imidazole daily 7 – 14days till response then 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>clotrimazole </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>500 weekly or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>* </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>50 – 100/day.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Not recommended</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Not recommended</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:51.05pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Pregnancy</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- topical or I/V</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- longer cour</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>se</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> clotrimazole 500 for 7ays</span></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="1414" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td colspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>Non Albicans</strong></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Nystatin 100000 p/v 12-14nights.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Boric acid or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>amphotericin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri"