-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>mycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> 500 BD for 10 – 14D</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Or</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Ofloxacin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> 200mg BD</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Or</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Ofloxacin 400 OD</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Rectal </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Azithr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>omycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>.</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:49.45pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>2 – 5m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> after </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>previous </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>infection </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:10pt''>* </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>so repeat testing 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> after t/m.</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:64.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>NR</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong> = </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Routinely </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>recommended</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Pregnancy </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>6 weeks.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>*</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Symptoms </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>persists</span></p><