<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6451]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abortion within 1 week of assessment.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6452]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood test = not routinely required, blood group is needed if &gt;12weeks.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6453]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>VTE prophylaxis:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6454]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH for 7 days</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6455]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High risk for thrombosis =&gt; start LMWH before abortion and for longer duration afterwards.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6456]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Choice of Procedure for Abortion.</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6457]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer choice.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6458]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If clinically not appropriate, then explain why.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6459]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Determining duration of Pregnancy</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6460]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. LMP – all pts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6461]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. USG if uncertainty or risk of ectopic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6462]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. Examination – If USG available</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6463]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abortion before USG evidence of I/U pregnancy.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6464]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before USG evidence</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6465]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>small risk of ectopic</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6466]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
