<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8274]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Palmers Point:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expected adhesions </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>23% </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transverse incision </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> midline incisions</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3cm below </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>left costal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>margin </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>I</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mid clavicu</