<h2 class="mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9122]" style="background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''>17.4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''>THROMBOPHYLAXIS IN GYNAECOLOGICAL SURGERIES</span></h2>
