<h3 class="mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9253]" style="background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>17.8. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>AN</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>ESTHESIA COMPLICATION:</span></h3>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9254]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post dural puncture headache, commonest complication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9255]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fronteal headache</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9256]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe in intensity</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9257]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Postural and relived by lying down </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9258]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>meningitis should be ruled out</span></p>', 0);

