ght:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>51%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:136.35pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>&gt;45</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:136.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>93%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9875]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> CAUSES OF RPL AND THEIR MANAGEMENT</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9876]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>APLA:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9877]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15% </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>RPL.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9878]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2% in healthy pregnancies.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9879]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>80% success after t/m.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9880]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10% </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>out t/m.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9881]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Work up:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>offer prior to pregnancy – 2+ve test 12 weeks apart and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at least</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 6 weeks post miscarriage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9882]" style="margin-left: 18pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9883]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Criteria of workup</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;3 – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage before 10 weeks.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9884]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 – 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9885]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 PTB before 34 weeks, due to comp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ations like placental insufficiency </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>early onset pre – eclampsia mainly iatrogenic birth.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9886]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">1.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LA:</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9887]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>strongest association.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9888]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dilute Russel viper venom + pl</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>atelet</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>neutr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; sensitive + specific.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9889]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>Med – high </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>t</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>iter</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>&gt; 90 centile</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>&gt; 40IU/ml</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ACA:</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9890]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-Glycoproten:</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9891]" style="margin-left: 18pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9892]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Aspirin(75mg) + LM</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>WH(40mg) f</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rom the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> start of pregnancy (upt positive) till 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9893]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9894]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">2.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Genetics: </strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9895]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2-5% of couples</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9896]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>         </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>balanced Translocation </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in 1 parent:</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9897]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrent miscarriages (further miscarriages 30-57% if embryonal chromosomal abnormality).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9898]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anomalous babies or babies with mental disability.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9899]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Healthy babie</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can also born with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>balanced genetic translocation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9900]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Work-up:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9901]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>POC karyotyp</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ing</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of 3rd concept</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>us</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9902]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Parent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>al</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> karyotyp</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ing</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> if </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9903]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>         </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>POC shows</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> an</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> un balanced</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>        </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>translocation or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9904]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  2. tissue not available for testing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9905]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - Refer to genetic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ist.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9906]" style="padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Proceed to natural pregnancy 50 – 70% healthy </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>live birth.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9907]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gamete donation + IVF.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9908]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PGD + IVF = 30% success.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9909]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adoption.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9910]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">3.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Anatomical:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9911]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>all </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>women with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>recurrent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriages</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9912]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 3D USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> gold standard</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9913]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Uterin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>e anomaly</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.8 – 37.6%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> more in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9914]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Septate – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>arcuate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>miscarriages</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9915]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Work up:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9916]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>all</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> women </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>three</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>one</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9917]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG + HSG – initial screening</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9918]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 3D USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is the diagnostic test</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hysteroscopic septostomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Audit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> /Research </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>context.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9921]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cervical</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> anomaly</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9922]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Cause </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>miscarriages, premature</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> ruptured membranes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or painless dilation.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9923]" style="margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Workup:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9924]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>One </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> miscarriage or suspected C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weakness.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9925]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG measurement of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervix.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9926]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Serial measurements</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> from 16 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 24weeks.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>C</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ervic</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>al</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> cerclage</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9929]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.ultrasound indicated cerclage if length is ≤2.5mm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9930]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.History indicated cerclage:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9931]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           3 or more 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trimester miscarriages</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9932]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           1 or more PTB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9933]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9934]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Abdominal Cerclage:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9935]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erclage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9936]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ery </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short or scarred C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervix</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9937]" style="margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
