 style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>=&gt; Anecho</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ic.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>         </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>=&gt; Echogenic</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>  In </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ruptured ectopic or leakage from fimbria, 28</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> – 56%.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  Mass moves </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>separate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> to ovary.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>BHCG</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> helpful in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>planning </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> management.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:160.65pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>1.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Systemic </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>Methotrexate</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>65-95% success</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>CRITERIA OF METHO</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  Never given @ 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> visit</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  B – HCG 1500 – 5000 </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  No pain</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-  I/U Gest</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> ruled out</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>      </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>=&gt; willing for F/U</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>      =&gt; G</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> &lt; 35mm </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> no FCA.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>  Avoid:</strong></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- alcohol &amp; folate containing vitamins.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>  </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>Contrac</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>ep</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>tion:</strong></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- for 3m` </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- 7% require surgical t/m.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>2.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong> Surgical:</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> pain – always surgical </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- lap</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>aroscopy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> – preferable </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>=&gt; salpingectomy </strong></span></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>preferable – 5% </li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Recurrent Ectopic – 56%or 40% pregnancy </li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>=&gt; Salpingo</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>tomy:</strong></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>fertility reducing factors</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> are present</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#FF0000;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>     </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> - prev</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ious</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> ectopic</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>      - C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ontralateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> tubal damage.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>      - prev</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ious</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> surgery.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- Risk of persistent Trophoblasts.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#FF0000;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>       </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>- follow up is needed</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>       - metho may be required </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> case of persistent d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>isease</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u>1/5</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#2F5496;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>=&gt; 8% ectopic </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>=&gt;60% pregnancy</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong>3.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u><strong> Expectant:</strong></u></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>success </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>57</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> – 100%,</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> 29% required additional t/m.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><strong>Indication:</strong></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>1.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> clinically stable.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>2.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> GS &lt; 30mm.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>3.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> B – HCG &lt;1500: </span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c09d65a61b33576c3e355b3e" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-07-002"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure c09d65a61b33576c3e355b3e" viewbox="533400 95250 190500 152400" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="f72b1f20ed03f4a85b73e93b0dded0b78f0c7cbba910c20b4b6779d5fc360ac5"><g data-mm-object-id="fa74e2cff79a3