<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10887]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>70,000 – affected worldwide.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10888]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>100 million – carrier worldwide.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10889]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1000 in UK are affected.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10890]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Thalassemia </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Major requiring</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10891]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>requiring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 7</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> transfusions</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/year.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10892]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Thalassemia </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Intermedia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10893]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7 or less/ or no </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of transfusions</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10894]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Thalassemia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosed @ 2 – 7years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10895]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Growth &amp; development Abnormalities without T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ransfusion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10896]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Corner stone of management =&gt; blood t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ransfusion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and chelation therapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10897]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complications of Iron overloa</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>d:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10898]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Subfertility – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hypogonadotropic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hypogonadism.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10899]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypothyroidism.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10900]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DM – damage to islet cells of pancreas</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10901]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiomyopathy – cardiac failure 50% cause of death.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10902]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Liver damage.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10903]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Osteoporosis (ca</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> chelation with chelating agents).</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10904]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pre conception counselling:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10905]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High dose folic Acid (all women).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10906]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adequate chelation prior to O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vulation induction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> conception.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10907]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All hormonal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>contraception</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – safe.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10908]" style="margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>MDT:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10909]" style="padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obstetrician – all women.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10910]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiologist – if cardiac problem.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10911]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hematologist – all women.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10912]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diabetologist if DM.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10913]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Infertility specialist.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10914]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>endocrinologist – if endocrinopathy.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10915]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>O</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>I </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>with</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> Gonadotrophins</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – if infertility – success of OI</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is more</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>good</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> chelation.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10916]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Optimum Glycem</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ic control</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – fructosamin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt;300nml/l – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at least</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to conception.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10917]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fructosamine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>300nml</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/l</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = HbA1C 43mmol/mol.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10918]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Optimiz</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>e</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> TFT’S</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – (if hypo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>thyroidism</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10919]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Optimiz</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>e</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> cardiac function:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(all women)</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10920]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consult </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiologist.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10921]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ECG.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10922]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Echo.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10923]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – MRI.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10924]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target &gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20ms</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10925]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- &gt;20ms minimal Iron.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10926]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- &lt;10ms – high load, risk of cardiac failure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10927]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – MRI &lt; 10ms +   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EF =&gt; C/I to pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10928]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10929]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>MDT review:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10930]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 146.75pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiologist, Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
