<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11245]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Antenatal assessment and management </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11246]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>HIGH RISK</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Requires antenatal prophylaxes with LMWH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer to trust – nominated thrombosis in pregnancy expert/ team.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(to be assessed at booking and repeated</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11247]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any previous VTE except a single event related to major surgery. (4)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>If admitted).</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11248]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11249]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11250]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hospital admission </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Single previous VTE related to major surgery.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>High – risk thrombophilia + no VTE. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Medical comorbidities e.g. cancer, heart failure, active SLE, IBD or inflammatory polyarthropathy, nephrotic syndrome, type I DM with nephropathy, sickle cell disease, current IVDU. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any surgical procedure e.g. appendectomy. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>OHSS (first trimester only). (4)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11251]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11252]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>INTEREDIATE RISK</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider antenatal prophylaxes with LMWH</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11253]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11254]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11255]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11256]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Obesity (BMI &gt; 30 kg/m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>2</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>. (½) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Age &gt; 35. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Parity </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> 3. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Smoker. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Gross varicose veins. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Current pre – eclampsia. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Immobility, e.g. paraplegia, PGP. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Family history of provoked or estrogen – provoked VTE in first – degree relative.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Low – risk thrombophilia PT Gene, f – V heterozygous obs APLA.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Multiple pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IVF/ ART.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Transient factors:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Dehydration/ hyperemesis: current systemic. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Infection: long – distance travel. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hypere</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>me</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>sis. (3)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11257]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Four or more risk factors:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prophylaxes from first trimester.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Three risk factors:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prophylaxes from 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11258]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11259]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11260]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
