<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11602]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Test Father</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (can be omitted to avoid risk of non-paternity).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11603]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>NiPT</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11604]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- K </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>after20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11605]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer to FMU.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG, MCA Doppler </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weekly C, D, K  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>other 1 – 2 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA &lt; 1.5 MOM = weekly USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 1.5 MOM = Fetal blood sampling/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cordocentesis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord blood </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bilirubin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DAT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Direct Ant Globulin Test.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery @ 37 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heterozygous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Homo </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Negative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>CFF</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>DNA</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Negative   positive</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetus @ risk of HDFN </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (false Negative before </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11606]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20 weeks).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11607]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FFDNA not ap</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>propriate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for dizygotic twins.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal Monitoring by USG:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PSV, MCA.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Polyhydramnios</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Skin edema.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiomegaly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Weekly</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in Pts with mod – high risk of HDFN.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- C, D </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>after 16weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11608]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
