<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer usg for EFW,AFI and umbilical artery doppler @between 28-30 weeks or 2 weeks before the previous event. Repeat after 4 weeks if results are normal</span></p>
