<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12655]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Immunological =</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> APLA screening, Anti ds DNA, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>anti-Ro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/La Ab, complement C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>4</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> levels.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12656]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>APLA =</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 30% pts of SLE are APLA +ve.</span></span></div>
