<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13808]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exclude other causes by CT.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13809]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/C pressure on </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lumber puncture</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 20cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of water</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13810]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13811]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weight loss</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> limit weight gain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> maximum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pounds in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pregnancy.</span></span></div>
