<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15123]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15124]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>Level of free T</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub> T</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>4</sub></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15125]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15126]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Production of T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>4</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> by thyroid gland </span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15127]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HSG levels    es in pregnancy in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trimester</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15128]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15129]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Binds to TSH receptors</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15130]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15131]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>Production of T</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub> and T</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>4</sub></span></p>
