un" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>         available. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- No LP. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>(lumber puncture)</span></p>
