egnancy.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>E.g.,</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Hypertensive disorders.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><em><strong>*</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> Significant bleeding.</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="62f5f33bcfcb119c179f13b3" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-018"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 62f5f33bcfcb119c179f13b3" viewbox="885825 19050 247650 495300" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="e90a748abca25a2791b6f244c63c57d6777c2d6abfb7daeab32c5dd5a7ec02f5"><g data-mm-object-id="32c71758ac5eb32c914a" transform="translate(916487 29664)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 340179 L 47625 340179 L 47625 0 L 142875 0 L 142875 340179 L 190500 340179 L 95250 435429 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#5B9BD5" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Serial USG from diagnosis till delivery.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:133.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><spa