<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17737]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early FGR up to 32 weeks:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* EFW</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* U/A </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doppler weekly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>24 – 35 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>26 – 28 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>29 – 31 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>32 – 33 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>34 – 36 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Individualized care.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 2.6ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 3ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 3.5ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AEDF or REDF in umbilical artery</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Monitor @ least twice weekly with CCTG and/or DV Doppler</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Management of FGR</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17738]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>                                         </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17739]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17740]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17741]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17742]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17743]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17744]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FGR 32 – 36 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* EFW - fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* U/A Doppler – weekly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 4.5ms.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AEDE.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery by 36 – 36 + 6weeks if PI &gt; 95</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th </sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>centile on UAD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Umbilical artery Doppler PI &gt; 95</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitor @ least twice weekly CCTG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17745]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17746]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17747]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17748]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17749]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17750]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AC/EFW &lt; 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> centile by 37 + weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>When FGR can’t be excluded.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any signs of centile redistribution.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STV &lt; 4.5.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AREDF.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>SGA by 39 + 0 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STV &lt; 4.5.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AREDF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver all SGA till 39 + 6 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>37 – 38 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 39 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>SGA Term 37 weeks onwards:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>* EFW - fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>* UAD weekly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17751]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17752]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
