<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18279]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>(AIUM classification of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>low-lying</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> placenta)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18280]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anterior placenta/ Previa + C </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Section.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Suspect </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Placenta A</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>ccreta</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong> Spectrum:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>MDT –    comp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>lic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>ations  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>  1. Emergency surgery in MDT care </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>23%. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>2. Non – MDT </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>care risk of emergency surgery </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>64</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>%.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Delivery @ 35 – 36+6 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Contingency plan for Em delivery.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Anterior Placenta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Low lying</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>                 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Previa </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>                     USG for PAS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PAS confirmed:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>refer to specialist unit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18281]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Anterior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>post</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>erior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> placenta</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>+ no C – section.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18283]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
