<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18289]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Previa</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>In both low lying or Previa.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Steroid before 34 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>C – section</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> 34 – 36 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>(late Pre – Term birth).</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Bleeding risk    ed with GA:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>35weeks – 4.7%.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>36 – 15%.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>37 – 30%.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>38 – 59%</span></p>
