<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18920]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Kle</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ih</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>au</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> test</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is not used for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> diagnosis of abruption but in negative mothers for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>estimation of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FMH</span></span></div>
