ass="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>Accreta</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>No additional surveillance</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>Abruption</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>No additional surveillance</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>Vasa Previa</span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:11pt''>If low lying placenta @ anomaly scan than TVS with Doppler to rule out Vasa Previa should be under taken.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19208]" style="margin-bottom: 10pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>Table </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>41</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>. </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>ANC OF SINGLETON PREGNANCY CONCEIVED USING ART</em></span></p>', 0);

