<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19690]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><u><strong>LABOUR AND DELIVERY:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19691]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>INTRAPARTUM CARE OF HEALTHY NORMAL PREGNANCIES</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19692]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>1.1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>BIRTH SETTING</span></p>
