<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19774]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>3.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Alongside midwifery </strong></em></span></p>
