><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:9pt''><strong>Previous complications</strong></span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:425.25pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Stillbirth or neonatal death with a known non-recurrent cause</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-top:0.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Pre-eclampsia developing at term</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Placental abruption with good outcome</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-top:1.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>History of previous baby more than 4.5 kg</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;padding-right:33.6pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Extensive vaginal, cervical, or third- or fourth-degree perineal trauma</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-top:12.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Retained placenta needing manual removal in theatre</span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-top:1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-top:0.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Previous term baby with jaundice requiring exchange transfusion</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:23.7pt;margin-top:0.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-14.75pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Major gynaecological surgery</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:84.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#282828;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:9pt''><strong>Current pregnancy</strong></span></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:425.25pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:39.4pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Antepartum bleeding of unknown origin (single episode after 24 weeks of pregnancy)</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:20.9pt;margin-top:12.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Body mass index (BMI) at booking (see the section on </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#0563C1;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u>impact of</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color:#0563C1;font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''><u>BMI on choice of place of birth</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>)</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0.4pt;margin-top:12.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Blood pressure of 140 mmHg systolic or 90 mmHg diastolic or more on 2 occasions</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0.4pt;margin-top:12.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Clinical or ultrasound suspicion of macrosomia</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Induction of labour</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Grand multiparity (parity 4 or more)</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-top:0.05pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Recreational drug use</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Under current outpatient psychiatric care</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Age 40 or over at booking</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Fibroids</span></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family:"Calibri", sans-serif;font-size:12pt''>Fetal abnormality</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19842]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19843]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19844]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Care during labor:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19845]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>One to one in all setting.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19846]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Communication:</strong></em></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19847]" style="padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clear, comprehensive, welcoming.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19848]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Empower women in decision making.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19849]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain all procedures and observations before they take place.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19850]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Take consen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t before examination or any interventio</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19851]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"> </span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19852]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Respect personal space, privacy and dignity</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19853]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Calm, confident, professional approach.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19854]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Make sure women is knowing about pain relief options.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19855]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Position and mobilization:</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19856]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adapt whatever position she finds comfortable except lying flat on back.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19857]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Encourage mobilization.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19858]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Upright position = </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19859]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduce pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19860]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>en</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage up to1 hour and 20 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19861]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>en</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19862]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Less c – section, instrumental birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19863]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood loss.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19864]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Support:</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19865]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Encourage women to have support from birth companion of her choice.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19866]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Hygiene measures</strong></em></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19867]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tap water for cleaning before examination.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19868]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Routine hygiene measures by staff</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19869]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PPE according to risks of exposure.</span></span></div>', 2);

