<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21326]" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Underlying causes and conservative Measures</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21327]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop oxytocin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tocolytics terbutaline 0.25mg S/C.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Left lateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V fluids if women are hypotensive secondary to epidural top – up.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Call an anesthetist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Maternal Position</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>hypotension</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Excessive Contractions</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can cause</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21330]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21331]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord compression</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21332]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterine blood flow</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21333]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21334]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Encourage to mobilize or </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adopt an alternate position</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21336]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21337]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">193.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No facial oxygen therapy</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21338]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">194.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No amnioinfusion.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fetal Scalp Stimulation</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21340]" style="margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspicious CTG with antenatal or intrapartum risk factors for compromise</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21341]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21342]"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21343]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">195.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Digital scalp stimulation</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- No acceleration </span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21344]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 252pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21345]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">196.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acceleration in FHR + improvement</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Expedite birth</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21346]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21347]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">197.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue FHR monitoring</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21348]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Record keeping for CTG:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21349]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">198.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Set date and time clock correctly on machine</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21350]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">199.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Set paper speed at 1cm/ min</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21351]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">200.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct labelling with women’s name, DOB, NHS Number, Pulse rate @ start of monitoring and date of CTG</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21352]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">201.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Save record Electronically or photocopy of CTG trace</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21353]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">202.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep record for 25 years</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21354]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">203.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sustained possible brain injury to baby =&gt; store CTG indefinitely.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21355]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21356]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21357]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21358]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
