<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21417]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>emergency C/S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 0.5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1/200</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21418]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>90% due to vaginal bleeding and fetal distress.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21419]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>M</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oxibustions – Chinese </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medicine    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fetal activity</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21420]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Consider:</strong></em></span></p>
