<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21868]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Try either </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>maneuver</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – depending up clinical situation and operator experience</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Inform consultant obs and anesthetist</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If patient is less mobile and have epidural</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post aspect of ant shoulder and post aspect of post shoulder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21869]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Internal rotatory </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>maneuvers</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery of posterior arm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21870]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21871]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of humerus </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21872]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fracture 2 – 12% </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21873]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21874]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
