<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21876]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>All four if possible 83% success </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Repeat </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>all above</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21877]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21878]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Consider:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Zav</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nelli – if both shoulders impacted</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cle</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>do</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tomy</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symphysio</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Baby delivered =&gt; Neonatologist =&gt; Consultant Neonatologist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incident reporting</span></p>
