<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21988]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Consider Trial in theater if</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Head 1/5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> palpable abdominally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Head is in mid pelvis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Rotation required</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Features suspicious of CPD – Short </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>stature</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>OP – position </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>BMI &gt;30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>EFW &gt; 4kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Continue in the labour room if:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Head is low – pelvic/outlet</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No rotation or rotates easily</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No features of CPD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21989]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Select optimal place for birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21990]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21991]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
