<h2 class="mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22276]" style="background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>14. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>MATERNAL COLLAPSE</strong></span></h2>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22277]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 90pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Ensure manual uterine displacement</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Call for help</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Assess breathing, pulse, B.P, FHR</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Regular assessment by MEWS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Identify cause of collapse and direct treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe environment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22278]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>YES </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22279]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stimulate &amp; assess response</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22280]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NO</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22281]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 108pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Check obstruction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Head tilt, chin lift</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Shout for help</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22282]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Airway open</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22283]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breathing normally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Turn into recover position</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check help is on the way</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regular asses MEOWS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Identify cause of collapse and direct treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Look for chest movement</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Listen for breathing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Feel for air</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22284]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assess for breathing to see </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22285]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No breathing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Start CPR</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22286]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Produces 30% of cardiac output</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''> of non – pregnant that i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>s further reduced by 10% by gravid uterus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22287]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CPR less effective if GA &gt; 20 weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- 30 compressions @ 100</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-120</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Depress 5 – 6cm @ center of chest</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Ventilations = 2 breaths @ 10/min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Until: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>defibrillator</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/ monitor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> attached</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22288]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ensure manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt 15 – 30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>.</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obese pts head side position</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is best</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for chest compression</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mouth – mouth if no airway adjunct available</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 ventilations to minimize interruption to chest compression</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22289]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22290]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22291]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22292]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22293]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asystole &amp; PEA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pulses V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Attach defibrillator assess rhythm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22294]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Some setting as non-pregnant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Left pad more lateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In heavier breast ant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; post</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pads.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Remove uterine monitors</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>shock</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>120-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>200 J biphasic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0 J monophasic</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22295]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22296]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediate CPR 30:2 for 2 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22297]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CPR 30:2 for 2min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22298]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>During CPR:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Establish I/V line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- High flow O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- intubate &amp; then continuous chest compression</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Correct reversible cause</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Adrenaline every 3-5min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Consider – Amiodarone, Atropine, Mg.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Antiarrhythmic</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Drugs:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 3 DC Shock </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amiodaro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>300mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> bolus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose 150mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If not available give lidoc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ai</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1st dose 1-1.5mg/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose: 0.5-0.75mg/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> DC Shock</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amiodarone 150mg</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22299]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Give Adrenaline 1mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> IV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22300]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22301]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> continue CPR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22302]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22303]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct reversible causes</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22304]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>T</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>s</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22306]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">350.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tension pneumothorax</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22307]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">351.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tamponade, Cardiac</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22308]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">352.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Toxic/ Therapeutic (Local anesthetist)</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22309]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">353.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombosis, Pulmonary</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22310]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">354.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombosis, coronary</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22311]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22312]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22313]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">355.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypoxia</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22314]" style="padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">356.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypovolemia</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22315]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">357.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypo/hyperkalemia – hyponatremia – oxytocin use</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22316]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">358.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>thermia.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22317]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">359.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrogen ions (acidosis)</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22318]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Other Considerations</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22319]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">360.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22320]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">361.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Empty uterus if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20weeks</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22321]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Important points regarding CPR;</strong></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22322]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reversible cause – survival </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is more</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22323]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Non pregnant – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>laryngeal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> airway or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>supraglottic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> airway are acceptable but not in pregnant it is not suitable due to risk of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> regurgitation,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> mucosal bleeding and further intubation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> difficulty due to blood and obscure</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> view.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22324]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> USG by expert to look for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>concealed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hemorrhage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22325]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vasov</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ag</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al &amp; epilepsy =&gt; commonest cause of collapse.</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22326]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22327]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Perimortem C/S</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22328]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">362.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>If &gt;20 weeks</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22329]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">363.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aim for uterine evacuation within 5 min</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22330]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">364.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>No response despite correct performance of CPR within 4 min</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22331]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">365.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Achieved within 5 min</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22332]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">366.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>69% in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>fan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>t survival</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22333]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">367.</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hypoxic brain damage of neonate if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>perimortem</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> C/S performed after 6min.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22334]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"> </p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22335]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiac arrest 50% survival of mother.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22336]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>54% survived until discharge</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22337]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>42% with mod – good Neurological outcomes.</span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22338]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">⇨</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More favorable outcome when CPR performed within 10min.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22339]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22340]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22341]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22342]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"> </p>
