<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22847]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Investigations:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22848]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Swabs;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to rule out </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: #2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Endometritis</strong></span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22849]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HVS</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22850]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endocervical </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22851]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG –</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to rule </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>out RPOC’S</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22852]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doppler – pseudo aneurysm, AVM</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22853]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22854]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antibiotics – If endometritis is suspected</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22855]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ERPC: by senior consultant</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22856]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of perforation 1.5%</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22857]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">-</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asherman syndrome</span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22858]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Embolization</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ongoing </span></span></div>
<div class="mm-para mm-list-item" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22859]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-list-marker" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="mm-list-body"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Balloon </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tamponade</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>bleeding.</span></span></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22860]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22861]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>USG</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> picture of</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> RPOC’S</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22862]" style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thickened endometrium</span></p>
